  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MANSEHRAH VILLAGE SUPPORT PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJ. AIMES AT IMPROVING THE QUALITY OF LIFE OF POOR SMA LL FARMERS,LANDLESS AND RURAL WOMEN IN THE RAINED MANSEHRA DISTRICT.MORE SPECIFICALLY,IT INTENDS TO INCREASE THE INCOME AND IMPLOYMENT OF THE RURAL POOR BY ADOPTING IMPROVED TECHNO LOGY IN AGRICULTURE INCLUDING THE DEVELOPMENT OF HORTICULTU_ RE AND ANIMAL HUSBANDRY AND BUILDING INFRASTRUCTURE FACILIT_ IES LIKE IRRIGATION AND FARM TO MAKET ROAD.</narrative>
  </description>
